cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "microparticle-detector: dark-ring circle detection for brightfield microscopy of colloidal microspheres"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic, training-free circle detection and sizing for dense label-free
  brightfield microscopy of colloidal microspheres. Two independent candidate
  generators (a dark-ring channel and a five-source rescue channel) feed a shared
  geometric verifier, followed by a series of size gates.
authors:
  - family-names: "He"
    given-names: "Qizhen"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-28"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - microscopy
  - particle detection
  - colloidal microspheres
  - image analysis
  - brightfield
